Skewering nerve agents: Conformal metal–organic framework (MOF) kebab structures decorated on nanofibers that can degrade chemical warfare agents
within minutes are described. These MOF–nanofiber composites show excellent reactivity towards both simulant and nerve agent soman (GD).
